# Sealed work orders

Every named role and Task launch needs a sealed work order: `role`, `packet_id`,
`root`, `write_set`, `routed_model`, `success_schema`, `halt_conditions`.
Unsealed `generalPurpose` output is not gate evidence.

Ceilings: `max_depth=1`, `max_children=6`, `no_redelegation=true`. A hit is
`halt_report`, not Sol/premium. Premium only via `route-model` allowlist plus
valid escalation and budget state not `hard_stop` (ADR-TR-001 TR-12).
